The training corpora in this folder are copied verbatim from the Apache OpenNLP
test resources (opennlp-tools/src/test/resources), which are licensed under the
Apache License 2.0:

    Apache OpenNLP
    Copyright 2017 The Apache Software Foundation

    sentences.train   <- opennlp/tools/sentdetect/Sentences.txt
    token.train       <- opennlp/tools/tokenize/token.train
    namefinder.train  <- opennlp/tools/namefind/AnnotatedSentences.txt
    postagger.train   <- opennlp/tools/postag/AnnotatedSentences.txt
    chunker.train     <- opennlp/tools/chunker/test.txt

They live here, rather than being read from either project's test resources,
because both runtimes have to train on byte-identical input for the resulting
models to be comparable. The .NET test project embeds its own copies of the same
upstream files for the ported unit tests; those are loaded from the assembly
manifest and are not interchangeable with a path on disk, so the harness reads
these instead. Keep them byte-identical to the upstream originals: a change to
either copy that is not made to the other silently makes the two sides train on
different data.
